{"title":"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> be a five digit number (whose first digit is non-zero) and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> be the four digit number formed from n by removing its middle digit. Determine all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/3/ac3f8f77f019433405ef87fc8759c7df8e1177ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n/m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"38\" height=\"20\" /> is an integer. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/0/ee0d5015270479d9e8179e1ea730b0b5f66109e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=10000a+1000b+100c+10d+e$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"294\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/a/08a16f67c0d03a834c87e9a0fde5f4e21d60ec44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=1000a+100b+10d+e$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"223\" height=\"14\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/a/a3a59bb1293ee3f6dec19de4019a7178874219ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$e$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are base-10 digits and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/a/1cae493c4855ca1cdd17c420fc6a97ebc082b591.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/3/ac3f8f77f019433405ef87fc8759c7df8e1177ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n/m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"38\" height=\"20\" /> is an integer, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/3/6b3d61b25b562ac73cc48df6d09cf6100f6059d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m|n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"34\" height=\"20\" />, or\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/1/e5173ba6d2d7aab087071ff6af45804039ddd30c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1000a+100b+10d+e|10000a+1000b+100c+10d+e.\\]\" width=\"450\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>This implies that\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/b/5db17f1c9e8fc33765fb8f7c4625dbdb8e736cfa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1000a+100b+10d+e|9000a+900b+100c.\\]\" width=\"351\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Clearly we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/d/4ed434a0fd66602e4e80071550e2ca191d6beaad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8(1000a+100b+10d+e)&lt;9000a+900b+100c&lt;10(1000a+100b+10d+e)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"631\" height=\"18\" />, as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is positive. Therefore, this quotient must be equal to 9 (note that this does not mean <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/d/a6d4e58f56d2598145abaf316c85b829c5a77f69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n/m = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"71\" height=\"20\" />), and\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/f/c6f8738dfe2afd857f435686659b68a89aa5697e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[9000a+900b+90d+9e=9000a+900b+100c.\\]\" width=\"380\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>This simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0dad51dc29af8dc182e6fa09692aa5ac1694ab6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90d+9e=100c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"126\" height=\"14\" />. The only way that this could happen is that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/0/a80d7a3ca845e6cae14b9db710b64331219ec3f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/a/95aa2e1f2b723a532cbfd9a3e627f00907c43c98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=e=0$\" width=\"75\" height=\"12\" />. Therefore the only values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/3/ac3f8f77f019433405ef87fc8759c7df8e1177ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n/m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"38\" height=\"20\" /> is an integer are multiples of 1000. It is not hard to show that these are all acceptable values.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO\">1971 Canadian MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 10\">10</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017170744\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 164/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1021/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 60/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4437/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.741      1 Template:Old_CanadaMO_box\n100.00%    6.741      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:11344:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017170744 and revision id 124895. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}